{"result":"{
  "id": "19207",
  "key": "SFCC-747",
  "summary": "Logo Masthead – PWA Kit Component",
  "description": "**As a** Shopper, **I want** to see the Zimmermann logo in the header on every page, **so that** I can identify the brand and return to the homepage from anywhere on the site.\n\nThis is a **PWA Kit component story**. It covers the build of the `Logo Masthead` React component in the PWA Kit storefront — the Zimmermann wordmark that renders in the header on every page across all storefronts and devices. The logo masthead was initially included as part of SFCC-52 (Global Header UI), which covered its visual placement only. This story supersedes the logo portion of SFCC-52 and defines the full `Logo Masthead` component including link behaviour, responsive sizing, and accessibility. The logo is a static brand asset — it is not managed in Contentful or Business Manager and does not vary by storefront. Scroll behaviour is explicitly out of scope and is covered in SFCC-93 (Logo Scroll Behaviour). Hover/focus visual states are defined in the UI kit and are not repeated here.\n\nMotion Design: [https://zimmermann-handover-ja2o39l78-song-ddp-anz.vercel.app/#templates%2Fmain](https://zimmermann-handover-ja2o39l78-song-ddp-anz.vercel.app/#templates%2Fmain)\n\nUI Kit: [https://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann*Design*System*2026?node-id=2083-53927&p=f&t=SM2wFRxPI0PhFS9u-0](https://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann*Design*System*2026) \n\n![\"image-20260830-233841.png\"](image-20260830-233841.png)",
