          "from_string": "*As a* Shopper, *I want* to see the Zimmermann logo in the header on every page, *so that* I can identify the brand and return to the homepage from anywhere on the site.\n\nThis is a *PWA Kit component story*. It covers the build of the {{Logo Masthead}} React component in the PWA Kit storefront — the Zimmermann wordmark that renders in the header on every page across all storefronts and devices. The logo masthead was initially included as part of SFCC-52 (Global Header UI), which covered its visual placement only. This story supersedes the logo portion of SFCC-52 and defines the full {{Logo Masthead}} component including link behaviour, responsive sizing, and accessibility. The logo is a static brand asset — it is not managed in Contentful or Business Manager and does not vary by storefront. Scroll behaviour is explicitly out of scope and is covered in SFCC-93 (Logo Scroll Behaviour). Hover/focus visual states are defined in the UI kit and are not repeated here.",
